<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Legal Billing & Time Tracker' }) %>
<style>
  .hero { padding: 56px 0 40px; }
  .badge {
    display: inline-block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
    padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;
    background: rgba(99,102,241,0.15); color: var(--accent2);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .hero h1 { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .hero-desc { font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted); max-width: 580px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .cta-link {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    background: var(--accent); color: #fff;
    padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none; transition: opacity .15s;
  }
  .cta-link:hover { opacity: .88; text-decoration: none; }
  .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin: 40px 0; }
  .feature-card {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px;
  }
  .feature-icon { font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .feature-card h3 { font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .feature-card p { font-size: 13px; margin: 0; }
  .steps { counter-reset: step; margin: 8px 0 0; }
  .step {
    display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .step:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .step-num {
    counter-increment: step;
    width: 28px; height: 28px; flex-shrink: 0;
    background: rgba(99,102,241,0.18); color: var(--accent2);
    border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
  }
  .step-num::before { content: counter(step); }
  .step-body h3 { font-size: 14px; margin: 2px 0 4px; }
  .step-body p  { font-size: 13px; margin: 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>
<main>
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="badge">Claude Cowork Plugin &nbsp;·&nbsp; by Protomated</div>
    <h1>Legal Billing &amp;<br>Time Tracker</h1>
    <p class="hero-desc">
      A Claude Cowork plugin for solo and small-firm attorneys. Track billable hours, generate
      invoices, manage trust accounts, and monitor revenue — all by chatting naturally with Claude.
      Your data is stored in a Google Sheet in your own Google Drive.
    </p>
    <a class="cta-link" href="https://protomated.com/templates/legal-billing-time-tracker/">
      Learn more at Protomated ↗
    </a>
  </div>

  <hr>

  <h2>What this app does</h2>
  <p>
    <strong style="color:var(--text)">Legal Billing & Time Tracker</strong> connects Claude Cowork
    to your Google account so you can manage your law firm's billing records by chat.
    It uses the Google Sheets API to read and write time entries, invoices, and trust account data
    to a spreadsheet in your own Google Drive, and the Google Drive API to create that spreadsheet
    on first use. Protomated only stores the OAuth tokens required to access your sheet on your behalf
    — your billing data never passes through our servers.
  </p>

  <hr>

  <h2>What you can do</h2>
  <div class="features">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">⏱</div>
      <h3>Log billable hours</h3>
      <p>Say "Log 2 hours for Smith estate matter at $350/hr" — it writes to your Google Sheet instantly.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">📄</div>
      <h3>Generate invoices</h3>
      <p>Invoice a client in one command. Unbilled entries are confirmed, then marked with today's invoice date.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">🏦</div>
      <h3>Manage trust accounts</h3>
      <p>Record deposits and withdrawals with safety checks. Running balance is auto-calculated.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
      <h3>Revenue dashboard</h3>
      <p>Total hours, fees billed, collected, and outstanding — pulled from your sheet on demand.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr>

  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num"></div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <h3>Install the plugin</h3>
        <p>Download the <code>.zip</code> from Protomated and upload it in Claude Cowork → Plugins → Add.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num"></div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <h3>Connect your Google account</h3>
        <p>Say "connect Google" in Claude. You'll authorize read/write access to your own Google Drive — your data never passes through Protomated's servers.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num"></div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <h3>Start billing by chat</h3>
        <p>Log hours, invoice clients, review trust balances, and check revenue — just by talking to Claude.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr>

  <h2>Your data stays with you</h2>
  <p>
    Your billing data lives in a Google Sheet in <strong style="color:var(--text)">your own Google Drive</strong>.
    Protomated stores only the OAuth tokens needed to write to that sheet and your sheet's URL.
    You can disconnect and delete your Protomated account at any time directly from Claude.
  </p>
  <p>
    Questions? Email <a href="mailto:dele@protomated.com">dele@protomated.com</a> or visit
    <a href="https://protomated.com">protomated.com</a>.
  </p>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
